{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/38cf29e38bfd555dabbdd8054afda3cc.poster.avif?t=1767305844\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/38cf29e38bfd555dabbdd8054afda3cc.webm?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/38cf29e38bfd555dabbdd8054afda3cc.mp4?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bookbound is a sci-fi adventure story about a boy who hates reading until a mysterious book takes him on an interdimensional journey through crumbling worlds. Guided by a cosmic stranger, Danko must save the universe. Bookbound is a genre-shifting adventure where every level offers a fresh perspective \u2014 both visually and mechanically. One world plays like a classic platformer, the next as a third-person narrative journey, and another plunges you into first-person exploration, and more... This constant evolution mirrors the power of a Danko (protagonist) imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/dd48bc46e9c5cf7a35178296d7c42118.poster.avif?t=1767305844\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/dd48bc46e9c5cf7a35178296d7c42118.webm?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/dd48bc46e9c5cf7a35178296d7c42118.mp4?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient Beacons, once created by long-lost civilizations to hold reality together, are shutting down \u2014 and with them, entire worlds are collapsing into nothingness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Danko, with the power of his imagination and pure heart, can reignite the Beacons and restore balance. To do so, he must journey across fractured worlds \u2014 each with its own rules, dangers, and visual language.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/2fae79756955fd238350f9c424937326.poster.avif?t=1767305844\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/2fae79756955fd238350f9c424937326.webm?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/2fae79756955fd238350f9c424937326.mp4?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to dive into a game where every new level means new mechanics, new settings, new challenges, and new adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll experience space flights, turn-based battles, puzzle solving, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From third-person to platformer, from first-person to top-down \u2014 in Bookbound, every step opens a new way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the universe with Danko. Unleash your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/589c8ddf5fa7418c1189e00cc0db053e.poster.avif?t=1767305844\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/589c8ddf5fa7418c1189e00cc0db053e.webm?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/589c8ddf5fa7418c1189e00cc0db053e.mp4?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050460?t=1767305844","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050460?t=1767305844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/3d31908f2efb253bdce7c52575cf6ab0fb345d42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767305844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/3d31908f2efb253bdce7c52575cf6ab0fb345d42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767305844","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/38cf29e38bfd555dabbdd8054afda3cc.poster.avif?t=1767305844\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/38cf29e38bfd555dabbdd8054afda3cc.webm?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/38cf29e38bfd555dabbdd8054afda3cc.mp4?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bookbound is a sci-fi adventure story about a boy who hates reading until a mysterious book takes him on an interdimensional journey through crumbling worlds. Guided by a cosmic stranger, Danko must save the universe. Bookbound is a genre-shifting adventure where every level offers a fresh perspective \u2014 both visually and mechanically. One world plays like a classic platformer, the next as a third-person narrative journey, and another plunges you into first-person exploration, and more... This constant evolution mirrors the power of a Danko (protagonist) imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/dd48bc46e9c5cf7a35178296d7c42118.poster.avif?t=1767305844\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/dd48bc46e9c5cf7a35178296d7c42118.webm?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/dd48bc46e9c5cf7a35178296d7c42118.mp4?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient Beacons, once created by long-lost civilizations to hold reality together, are shutting down \u2014 and with them, entire worlds are collapsing into nothingness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Danko, with the power of his imagination and pure heart, can reignite the Beacons and restore balance. To do so, he must journey across fractured worlds \u2014 each with its own rules, dangers, and visual language.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/2fae79756955fd238350f9c424937326.poster.avif?t=1767305844\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/2fae79756955fd238350f9c424937326.webm?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/2fae79756955fd238350f9c424937326.mp4?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to dive into a game where every new level means new mechanics, new settings, new challenges, and new adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll experience space flights, turn-based battles, puzzle solving, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From third-person to platformer, from first-person to top-down \u2014 in Bookbound, every step opens a new way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the universe with Danko. Unleash your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/589c8ddf5fa7418c1189e00cc0db053e.poster.avif?t=1767305844\" width=730 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/589c8ddf5fa7418c1189e00cc0db053e.webm?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/extras/589c8ddf5fa7418c1189e00cc0db053e.mp4?t=1767305844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SoerGameStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050460/8eb1ddb804ac0dc04c67c96e7c3c07835b642d2a/header.jpg?t=1767305844","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4050460/706937836/b0c9a080c934860ac99d28fa1256f67e1a08eb07/1758374078/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758741224","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamsta